WEBVTT

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.850
yume oikakete tatakai tsuzukero
Chase after your dreams and continue the fight

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.190
ai to yuuki to yuujou
Love, courage, and friendship

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.690
kono blade wa ore no bunshin
This Blade is my other self

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.770
chikara no kagiri moero maware
To the limits of my power, spin and be set ablaze

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.820
Burning Soul

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.250
hitori bocchi ja dekinai
I can't do it all alone

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:50.170
koto mo omae ga ireba yareru
I can do it with you alongside me

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.010
kono sekai no hate made mo
Come with me

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:56.350
ore to issho ni ikou
All the way to the end of the world

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.580
shi seijuu wa ai no athlete
The four Sacred Beasts are the athletes of love

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:07.150
kagayake me wo samase
They shine as they awake

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.790
Dragoon! Dranzer! Draciel! Driger!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.490
yomigaere
Resurrect!

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:16.110
sore kakete koi ore no energy
Take to the skies, my energy!

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:19.450
ima tachiagare seijuu
The time has come to stand up, Sacred Beasts!

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.880
subete no teki wo uchitaosu tame
To defeat all our foes

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.100
minna no kibou daite kakero
Hold on tight to all our hopes

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.100
Shining Soul!

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:35.040
"The Curtain Opens! Battle Tournament"

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:01.580
These are the red-hot battles
that you've all been waiting for!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.850
The Super Battle Tournament starts now!

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:08.760
I'm everyone's big bro,
Blader DJ! Nice to meet you!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:18.400
Only the players that win in the A-B-C-D
preliminary blocks will move onto the finals!

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.000
First up is the preliminaries for the A-block!

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.020
The last one to survive
will move up the finals!

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.820
It's a real survival battle!

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.670
Well then, let's start!

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.330
Three! Two! One!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.620
Go Shoot!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.360
It seems like everyone's
having fun, doesn't it?

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.590
Oh, Chairman Daitenji.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:49.570
The players' levels are high, so I think we can look forward to some great battles.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:50.480
Indeed.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.830
Excuse me! Move, move, move!

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:55.150
I'm late! I'm late! I'm late!

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.750
I'm sorry!

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:59.030
Sorry! Move, please!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.610
He's lively as usual.

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.990
Do you know him?

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.040
Just a little.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.300
"Entrant waiting room"

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:14.270
I was really worried
you'd be late, you know?

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:19.840
Sorry! I was practicing my special move
this morning and I got a little too into it.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.560
The preliminaries for the
A-block have already started.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.550
I know, I know.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:31.020
There's so many Bladers!
Is everyone here entered in?

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.300
That's because people from
all over Japan are here.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.700
Furthermore, they're all strong Bladers.

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.000
<i>From here on out,
I'm gonna fight these people...</i>

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.720
That's the end of the
A-block preliminaries!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.100
Yay!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:48.240
Max is moving on from
the A-block to the finals!

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.080
Max!

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.040
Yay! Takao, that was a piece of cake!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.600
That means you finished
your adjustments, right?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:01.490
Of course. My new
weapon is really strong.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:06.160
I've got a special move now, too.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.620
What is it? I'm very interested.

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:11.680
You see--

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.800
Stop!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.920
If you say it now it won't
be a secret anymore!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.660
That's right.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.740
Next up is the B-block preliminaries!

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.540
All players please get ready!

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.760
Oh, it's my turn.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.140
Wow, you're entering, too?

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.550
What about you?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.960
I'm in the C-block. The one after this.

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.590
Let's do our best
and aim for the top!

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.240
Yeah!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.340
It's finally time for
the B-block preliminaries!

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.880
The surviving ten, please
proceed to the last stadium!

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.200
Look! Kyoujyu's still in!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.300
He is! Wow!

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.180
The final battle can
have up to two winners!

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:05.680
But you won't move on if you don't
survive for at least two minutes,

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.180
even if you're the
last in the stadium!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:15.040
That means that each block
may have no winners.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.610
That's so strict!

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:19.340
No surprise since it's
a national tournament.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.190
Good luck, Kyoujyu!

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:24.590
You need stamina to last
in the survival battle!

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.670
Who'll be the last one standing?

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.770
Let's find out!

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.700
Three! Two! One!

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.470
Go Shoot!

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:49.480
Whoa, an attack right off the bat
has sent two Beyblades out!

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:56.850
Doesn't that Beyblade belong to...?!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.810
Kai Hiwatari.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:04.390
It really is Kai's Dranzer.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.030
Go, Dranzer!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.700
Kai is sending his rivals
out with blinding speed!

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.190
Whoa...

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.040
Its attack has increased by
a lot compared to last time.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.710
It looks like it's on par
with your Dragoon!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:25.680
However...

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.300
Its movements are too intense.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.570
Will it last for 2 minutes?

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:32.490
<i>That's true.</i>

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:35.290
<i>It won't be able to continue
spinning at that high pace...</i>

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:37.390
<i>What's he thinking?</i>

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.800
The last player is out!

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:45.080
Is Kai the only one left?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.680
No, not yet!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.360
Kyoujyu's...

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.490
Kyoujyu's Bey is still in!

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:56.080
But it's making some
strange movements!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.260
Has it been using the
spring to dodge attacks?

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:02.390
Wow, it's a miracle!

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:03.410
Talk about lame...

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:08.060
The preliminaries has two
survivors! One minute to go!

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.230
There's no need to battle.

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:12.500
Is this how it's going to end?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.030
All according to calculation.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:18.050
Least amount of pain
for the most gain!

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:21.050
This is the answer my
research came up with!

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.800
How foolish.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.630
A victory gained from
running isn't a victory.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.530
Let me show you.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:31.560
That battles are ruled by power!

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.790
Finish him, Dranzer!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.300
Oh, Kai's attacking!

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.260
But why?!

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:47.360
He's attacking even
though his victory is sealed?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:53.860
Impossible! According to my calculations, it
shouldn't have enough power left to attack!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:00.370
My Dranzer isn't a
Beyblade you can calculate.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.410
No, this battle has no meaning!

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.660
One winner is enough.

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.750
Go, Fire Arrow!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.520
Kyoujyu!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.090
Takao!

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.780
Takao!

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:36.980
<i>That's it!</i>

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.810
<i>Kai's Dranzer...</i>

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:41.140
<i>What happened to it?!</i>

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.600
What?

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:57.600
Look at that!
Dranzer is still spinning!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:01.700
Unlike before, it's now
spinning peacefully!

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.230
No way!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.340
Magnificent!

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:20.400
Wow. Even after dealing
out all those attacks,

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.790
it's still up!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:28.070
I didn't know such a balanced
Beyblade could exist...

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:33.130
Like I said, Dranzer isn't a
Beyblade you can calculate.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.520
I've lost.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.360
That's the end of the
B-block preliminaries!

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:48.400
The only winner is Kai!

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.410
Kai!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.970
How dare you!

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:16.740
Stop this, Takao!

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:18.960
Kyoujyu!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:23.370
Let go! I said let go! Aren't you mad?!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.560
If he didn't go out of his way,
you would've gotten past the prelims!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.960
It's frustrating.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:31.740
But what Kai did isn't wrong.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:35.850
Beyblading is about
winning or losing.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.650
There's nothing complicated about it.

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:43.070
I lost because my calculations
weren't good enough.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:45.950
Kyoujyu...

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.800
It's your turn next.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.630
Do your best.

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:52.780
Yeah.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.280
Give your friendly delusions a rest.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.270
What?!

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.090
I have nothing to say to losers.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.160
Wait! Kai Hiwatari!

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.240
I swear I'm gonna put an end to this!

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.810
You can bet I'll make
it to the finals, too!

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.920
We'll see if you actually can.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.950
I'm looking forward to it.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:38.680
It's finally the start of
the C-block preliminaries!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:42.790
Who will be the ones
to survive this group?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.420
Is he thinking that he'll fight Kai?

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:49.470
Stay confident while you can.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:53.380
Takao Kinomiya, we'll be
the ones to defeat you!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:05.760
Now, the C-block preliminaries! Battle...

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.990
Go Shoot!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:18.430
Takao's is looking good!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:21.000
He's raring to go.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:24.030
Takao likes Beybattling with all his heart.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:26.740
And the stronger the opponent,

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.690
the more he gets into it.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:32.890
Yes, I did it!

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.680
I'm in tip-top shape!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.110
All right, I'll win the
prelims if this keeps up.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.590
Don't count your chickens
before they hatch, Kinomiya.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.370
It's the Shell Killers!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.310
Don't forget about me.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:47.860
Hiruta!

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:51.400
The C-block has finally
reached its final battle!

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:55.200
The five are the only ones
who survived the first stage.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.600
And what awaits them is...

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.070
a stage filled with obstacles!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:05.740
Only up to two players will
move onto the final round!

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:09.600
The last battle to win
the prelims begins now!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.880
What a cool stage!

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:15.120
The stage isn't the only enemy.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.480
His opponents are all
from the Shell Killers.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:21.200
It's going to be a rough
four-on-one battle.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.360
Takao, go fight!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.010
This is going to be your
grave, Takao Kinomiya!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:34.170
<i>I don't know what kind of
attacks these guys are gonna pull.</i>

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:37.670
<i>But I'll just keep
fighting my own way.</i>

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.190
It's the last round for the
C-block's preliminaries!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:46.960
Let's get things started!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:49.390
Three! Two! One!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:51.470
Go Shoot!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.400
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:12.070
Triangle Attack!

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.190
We've got him!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.030
This is our true strength.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:18.440
See this, Kinomiya?

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:21.200
We're on a different
level than Hiruta!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.220
It's a three-man team play!

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:32.140
<i>I could move freely if these
obstacles weren't in the way...</i>

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:37.480
<i>Wait... if I use them instead...</i>

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:42.090
--You won't escape!
--You won't escape!

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:55.570
What?!

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:56.960
He did it!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:59.040
Amazing! A miracle!

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:16.290
Go! Spin Cutter!

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:25.260
What?!

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.120
It's so powerful...

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.440
No, it's not just powerful.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:38.350
The way the Bey broke is odd...

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.140
You're right.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.800
Take a look. That sturdy attack ring

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:44.520
was split in two in one hit.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.920
It might have a knife or
something hidden in it.

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.910
That is a dangerous Beyblade.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.420
The only survivors are these two players!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.690
They'll both move
onto the next round!

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:02.230
I did it because it'd be an easy kill.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.860
That's how I play.

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:08.690
Hiruta, you betrayed
the Shell Killers!

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.880
Betrayed?

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:15.150
Only the strong survive.
Isn't that the rule of the Shell Killers?

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.710
After Takao beat me and I was
kicked out of the Four Horsemen,

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.820
I decided that...

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:23.800
I would win, no matter what.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:28.640
And that means I'd beat whoever
stood in my way in this tournament.

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:31.620
Even Kai, too!

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:34.480
This Bey's going to eat
you all for breakfast!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.810
Wait, Hiruta!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.580
Hiding a knife
inside of your Bey...

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:46.140
Are you saying you're fine with
breaking the rules in order to win?

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:50.440
Exactly. It doesn't matter how you
do it. Whoever wins is the strongest.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.200
This is a tool for that purpose.

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:58.020
It's crying...

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.720
Your Beyblade's crying
because of your cheap tricks.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.220
That's stupid. This
Beyblade belongs to a winner.

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:08.340
It's not crying. It's <i>laughing</i>!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:11.790
You don't even understand
a Beyblade's heart!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.030
Someone like you...

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.360
has no right to call
himself a Beyblader!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:18.720
So what? Are you going to beat me?

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:21.440
Is that a challenge?

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.090
Yeah, it is!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:28.320
Takao Kinomiya has
already cleared the prelims,

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:30.960
but he challenged
Hiruta to a battle!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.920
This is getting interesting.

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:36.270
What's gotten into Takao?

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.730
He's already in the finals, too...

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:44.320
At the moment, Takao's head is filled with
anger at Hiruta for using such a cheap Bey.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.190
<i>What a moron.</i>

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.200
<i>Had you stayed quiet you
would have gone to the finals.</i>

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.240
<i>You said my Bey is crying?</i>

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:54.880
I won't forgive someone
who hurts their Beyblades!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.520
Talk tough while you can.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.340
Idiot! It doesn't matter
what your Bey is,

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.580
I'll rip it to shreds in one hit!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:11.360
<i>If I attack from head on, I'll
play right into that Bey's trap.</i>

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:14.390
<i>I've only got one
chance to attack.</i>

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:16.450
He's going to use <i>that</i> move.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.770
That move? What?

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:25.450
Here I come, Kinomiya!

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:32.300
Go, Dragoon!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.300
Screw Shoot!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:40.340
Incredible! Dragoon is advancing left and right down the stadium!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.960
Your tricks won't stop me!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:45.610
Go, Spin Cutter!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.670
What?!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:57.990
Takao's Beyblade disappeared!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.650
Wow! Dragoon disappeared!

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.840
That's Takao's special move!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:05.120
A miracle! It's beautiful!

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.740
Over there!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:13.250
Damn it! Where? Where is it?!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.010
Now!

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:43.120
No way...

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:46.590
The winner is Kinomiya!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:50.590
Takao Kinomiya has passed
the C-block preliminaries!

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:58.700
Amazing...

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:01.530
His Beyblade disapppears...

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:04.040
Spinning his arm during the shoot

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:07.140
brings forth incredible spin speed and those erratic movements.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:10.410
Which makes it possible to move
so fast that it can't be seen.

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.800
It's a move that can only be
used by Takao and Dragoon.

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.640
My Beyblade... is crying...?

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.670
Take care of it.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.760
Kinomiya...

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:33.940
Let's...

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:36.880
play again next time.

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:39.590
Fair and square, that is.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:45.280
I lost. Now, go.

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:46.510
Yeah.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.100
The C-block's preliminaries are done!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:55.170
Only the D-block remains!

00:20:56.970 --> 00:21:00.510
This tournament is turning out to be more successful than I had imagined.

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:07.520
As the battles continue, I can see how much these Bladers have grown.

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:11.660
Now it's your turn to
let us see your battle.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.290
It's not a battle.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.240
I'm just going
out on the prowl.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.440
It'll be over before you know it.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:44.780
haru wa te wo furi hohoende
Spring smiles when meeting again

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:50.240
natsu wa jounetsu wo furimaite
Summer is sprinkled with passion

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:55.420
kisetsu wa utsurikawatte
The seasons change

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:59.610
aki wa fuyu ga tomodachi
and Autumn is friends with Winter

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:05.720
kaiketsu dekinai koto tte
There are some things you can't solve

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:11.580
shinrai yuujou aijou kanjou
Like trust, friendship, love, and feelings

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:18.850
donna toki demo kumo wa nagareteru
No matter when, the clouds will continue to flow

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:24.230
itsudatte onaji sora wa nai
No two skies are alike

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:29.140
ruisen takamatte ochiru shizuku datte
Just because drops of water are welling up in my eyes

00:22:29.140 --> 00:22:33.140
kanashii wake dake janai
doesn't mean I'm sad

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:39.470
yuuki wo dashite kotoba ni shitemiru
I'll drum up my courage and try to put it in words

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:44.840
saa tabidatou kibou no machi e
"C'mon, let's take a journey to the city of hopes"

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:49.800
yakusoku datte kanarazu kanau sa
I always keep my promises

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:54.480
(It's) gonna be a clear day

00:22:58.260 --> 00:23:02.410
According to my knowledge, the first semi-final match is about to start.

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.900
A good battle between Max and Kai!

00:23:05.100 --> 00:23:10.880
Will Max's Protoshell lose against
Kai's Dranzer's newfound strength?

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:14.850
And then, a new Sacred Beast
emerges from Protoshell's Bit!

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:16.390
What is this Sacred Beast?

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:19.980
Next Time! "Clash! Max VS Kai"!

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:20.290
Clash! Max VS Kai
Next Time! "Clash! Max VS Kai"!

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:23.920
I'm getting more and more
interested in that mysterious Chinese boy!
Clash! Max VS Kai

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.020
Clash! Max VS Kai
